From: ProjectM TV contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve evaluated custom-shape thickness per instance

Follow MilkDrop2 evaluated int-nonzero flags within the defined int32
truncation domain. Capture style once per instance for authored and
Native replay. Preserve saved style outside that domain and raw values.
Keep existing batches, fill/order/sampler/float/half-pixel policies; no
grouping, extra buffer or repeated equation evaluation.

